THINK builds_on turntable-O builds on pin-F (8047-step-03), and rests on beam-C (8047-step-02)
THINK mechanism turntable-O becomes the base fixed (pins E, F, P, Q), top turning of the swing ring
THINK state swing has 1 of 3 parts, still missing pinlong-1, pinlong-2
THINK later The black-toothed half faces up once the model is flipped in step 16 and will carry the cab. Pattern: turntable joint between undercarriage and upper body
